# Cloudflare Pages — Redirects
# Portfolio: Nilay N. Jaltare
#
# IMPORTANT: Replace "yourdomain.com" with your actual domain on both lines below.
# Rules are processed top-to-bottom. First match wins.
#
# http → https is handled automatically by CF's "Always Use HTTPS" edge setting.
# Do NOT add http→https rules here — CF does it faster at the network edge.

# www → apex (301 permanent redirect)
# Redirects www.yourdomain.com/any/path → yourdomain.com/any/path
https://www.njaltare.uk/* https://njaltare.uk/:splat 301

# Anchor links (#about, #skills, #projects etc.) are client-side hash routing.
# They never reach the server — no redirect rules needed for them.

# No SPA catch-all needed. This is a single HTML file.
# CF Pages serves 404.html automatically for unmatched paths.
